 water  go for a hot girl walk do a full pilates  workout with the cute matching set drink  your green juice write in your journal  meditate shower do your 10 steps skin  care routine and read two chapters of a  best-selling book all before  9 a.m who  has that kind of time like even on a  weekend it's a lot so balancing work and  life as that girl all day every day is  next to impossible especially for women  with family responsibilities so don't  kill yourself in pursuit of trying to do  it all because social media has told you  to i mean life is chaotic it's  unpredictable and in covetings it is  hella exhausting like some of us over  here are just trying to survive another  day  no more so maybe that girl for you looks  nothing like the girls on tick tock  maybe that girl is working on fostering  more self-love maybe that girl spends  her days dedicated to working hard and  finishing her degree so she can land her  dream job maybe that girl shows up to  therapy to heal her trauma and tend her  emotional needs maybe that girl works by  day and raises her family by night maybe  that girl sleeps until noon when her  body needs rest and doesn't feel guilty  about it maybe that girl eats balanced  meals most days but doesn't eat any  vegetables other days maybe that girl is  breastfeeding two babies at once for  most of us that girl is not the same  girl and that girl doesn't look the same  every day and most of the time  self-improvement is not aesthetic or  glamorous but the point is that girl  should be unique to you and not  something that tick-tock tells you it  should be so on that note  that is all that i have for you guys  today thank you again to buildbar for  sponsoring if you like this video be  sure to give it the thumbs up subscribe  to the channel and i'll see you next  time on abby's kitchen bye  [Music]
 

